<div class="lj-table-wrap"><table class="lj-cmp">
<thead><tr><th>Niveau eIDAS</th><th>Ce qu’il garantit</th><th>Cas d’usage recommandés</th><th>Dans Lumen Juris</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Signature simple</td>
<td>Identification déclarative du signataire, intégrité du document scellée et horodatée. Force probante appréciée au cas par cas par le juge, appuyée sur le dossier de preuve.</td>
<td>Contrats commerciaux courants, NDA, devis, mandats, documents internes.</td>
<td><span class="lj-badge-ok">Incluse · gratuite</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>Signature avancée</td>
<td>Lien univoque avec le signataire, détection de toute modification ultérieure, vérification renforcée de l’identité (art. 26 eIDAS).</td>
<td>Contrats de travail, baux, compromis, contrats à enjeu financier significatif.</td>
<td><span class="lj-badge-opt">Option · via notre intégration DocuSign, prestataire certifié eIDAS</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>Signature qualifiée</td>
<td>Certificat qualifié délivré après vérification d’identité en face à face ou équivalent. Seul niveau bénéficiant d’une présomption légale de fiabilité (art. 1367 C. civ., al. 2).</td>
<td>Actes à très fort enjeu : marchés publics, actes d’engagement, certains actes notariés.</td>
<td><span class="lj-badge-no">Non proposée à ce jour</span></td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"},{"id":"ljtblb","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Essayez la signature gratuitement","align":"center","link":{"url":"https://www.lumenjuris.com/contactez-nous/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""},"typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"700","background_color":"#1B2A4A","button_text_color":"#FFFFFF","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"8","right":"8","bottom":"8","left":"8","isLinked":true},"text_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"14","right":"28","bottom":"14","left":"28","isLinked":false},"typography_text_decoration":"none"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"button"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"ljtmo9","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","background_background":"classic","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"60","right":"40","bottom":"60","left":"40","isLinked":false},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"20","bottom":"70","left":"20","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":35,"column":"35","row":"35"},"flex_align_items_mobile":"center","margin_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"20","right":"20","bottom":"20","left":"20","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"ljtmoh","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Une e-signature pensée pour les métiers du droit","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":32,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"700","align":"center","title_color":"#000000","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ljtmoi","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>De la signature électronique du contrat de travail au NDA, du compromis préparatoire aux protocoles d’accord, chaque métier du droit a ses documents récurrents, et ses contraintes de preuve. Lumen Juris couvre les actes sous signature privée du quotidien : vous signez en ligne, votre cocontractant signe à distance, et le niveau de signature s’adapte à l’enjeu de chaque document plutôt qu’à une offre commerciale figée.</p>","align":"center","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"ljtmor","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"row","content_width":"full","flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":30,"column":"30","row":"30"},"flex_direction_mobile":"column","flex_align_items_mobile":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"ljprf0","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","content_width":"full","width":{"unit":"%","size":"33"},"width_mobile":{"unit":"%","size":"100"},"background_background":"classic","background_color":"#FFFFFF","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"28","right":"24","bottom":"28","left":"24","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":12,"column":"12","row":"12"}},"elements":[{"id":"ljpri0","elType":"widget","settings":{"selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-balance-scale","library":"fa-solid"},"primary_color":"#1C1C1C","size":{"unit":"px","size":26,"sizes":[]},"align":"left"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"icon"},{"id":"ljprh0","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Avocats & cabinets","header_size":"h3","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ljprt0","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Conventions d’honoraires, mandats, protocoles transactionnels : la signature électronique avocat supprime les allers-retours papier avec vos clients, tout en conservant un dossier de preuve daté pour chaque acte signé.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":14,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","text_color":"#39445A","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljprf1","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","content_width":"full","width":{"unit":"%","size":"33"},"width_mobile":{"unit":"%","size":"100"},"background_background":"classic","background_color":"#FFFFFF","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"28","right":"24","bottom":"28","left":"24","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":12,"column":"12","row":"12"}},"elements":[{"id":"ljpri1","elType":"widget","settings":{"selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-briefcase","library":"fa-solid"},"primary_color":"#1C1C1C","size":{"unit":"px","size":26,"sizes":[]},"align":"left"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"icon"},{"id":"ljprh1","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Juristes & directions juridiques","header_size":"h3","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ljprt1","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Contrats commerciaux, NDA, avenants, conditions générales : faites signer vos cocontractants à distance et gardez chaque version, chaque signature et chaque preuve dans la même contrathèque.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":14,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","text_color":"#39445A","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljprf2","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","content_width":"full","width":{"unit":"%","size":"33"},"width_mobile":{"unit":"%","size":"100"},"background_background":"classic","background_color":"#FFFFFF","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"28","right":"24","bottom":"28","left":"24","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":12,"column":"12","row":"12"}},"elements":[{"id":"ljpri2","elType":"widget","settings":{"selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-users","library":"fa-solid"},"primary_color":"#1C1C1C","size":{"unit":"px","size":26,"sizes":[]},"align":"left"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"icon"},{"id":"ljprh2","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"RH, notariat & opérationnels","header_size":"h3","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ljprt2","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Contrats de travail et avenants RH en signature avancée, promesses et compromis préparés en amont des actes authentiques : chaque document part signé plus vite, sans impression.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":14,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","text_color":"#39445A","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":false},{"id":"ljsecu9","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"20","bottom":"70","left":"20","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":22,"column":"22","row":"22"}},"elements":[{"id":"ljsecuh","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Un logiciel de signature électronique sécurisé et souverain","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","typography_font_weight":"700","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":32,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]},"align":"center"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ljsecut","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Faire signer un contrat en ligne, c’est confier à un tiers des données parmi les plus sensibles de l’entreprise : identité des parties, conditions financières, clauses confidentielles. Lumen Juris a été conçu comme un outil juridique français : vos documents sont hébergés en France, les traitements sont conformes au RGPD, et les échanges entre votre navigateur, vos signataires et nos serveurs sont chiffrés. Vos contrats ne sont ni revendus, ni exploités pour entraîner des modèles d’IA tiers.</p><p>Pour la signature avancée, nous nous appuyons sur un prestataire de services de confiance certifié au sens du règlement eIDAS, via notre intégration DocuSign : vous bénéficiez d’une infrastructure de confiance auditée, sans quitter votre espace Lumen Juris. Et parce qu’un logiciel de signature électronique ne vaut que par la preuve qu’il produit, chaque signature génère un dossier de preuve horodaté, conservé avec le contrat dans votre contrathèque. Vous retrouvez qui a signé quoi, quand, et dans quelle version : des années plus tard s’il le faut. L’<a href="https://www.lumenjuris.com/qui-sommes-nous/">équipe Lumen Juris</a>, juristes et ingénieurs français, développe et opère la plateforme en direct.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"ljsecul","elType":"widget","settings":{"icon_list":[{"_id":"ljsc0","text":"<strong>Hébergement en France</strong> : documents, signatures et dossiers de preuve restent sur le territoire.","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"}},{"_id":"ljsc1","text":"<strong>Conformité RGPD</strong> : finalités limitées, pas d’exploitation de vos données à d’autres fins.","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"}},{"_id":"ljsc2","text":"<strong>Chiffrement des échanges</strong> : communications protégées de bout en bout du dépôt du document à sa signature.","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"}}],"space_between":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"icon_color":"#1C1C1C","icon_color_hover":"#1C1C1C","icon_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"text_indent":{"unit":"px","size":12,"sizes":[]},"icon_typography_typography":"custom","icon_typography_font_family":"Roboto","icon_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"icon_typography_font_weight":"400","icon_typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.6,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"icon-list"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"ljfaq9","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","background_background":"classic","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"60","right":"40","bottom":"60","left":"40","isLinked":false},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"20","bottom":"70","left":"20","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":30,"column":"30","row":"30"}},"elements":[{"id":"ljfaqh","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Signature électronique en ligne : vos questions","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":32,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"700","align":"center","title_color":"#000000","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ljfqa0","elType":"widget","widgetType":"nested-accordion","settings":{"items":[{"_id":"ljfq00","item_title":"La signature électronique a-t-elle une valeur légale en France ?"},{"_id":"ljfq01","item_title":"Quelle différence entre signature simple, avancée et qualifiée ?"},{"_id":"ljfq02","item_title":"Peut-on signer un contrat en ligne gratuitement ?"},{"_id":"ljfq03","item_title":"Comment faire signer un document à distance à mon cocontractant ?"},{"_id":"ljfq04","item_title":"Quels documents juridiques peut-on signer électroniquement ?"},{"_id":"ljfq05","item_title":"Le dossier de preuve suffit-il en cas de litige ?"},{"_id":"ljfq06","item_title":"Où sont hébergées les données et sont-elles conformes au RGPD ?"},{"_id":"ljfq07","item_title":"Faut-il installer un logiciel de signature électronique ?"}],"title_tag":"h3","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-plus","library":"fa-solid"},"selected_active_icon":{"value":"fas fa-minus","library":"fa-solid"},"title_typography_typography":"custom","title_typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","title_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":17,"sizes":[]},"title_typography_font_weight":"600","normal_title_color":"#1C1C1C","accordion_background_background":"classic","accordion_background_color":"#FFFFFF","accordion_border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"accordion_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"18","right":"22","bottom":"18","left":"22","isLinked":false},"space_between_widgets":{"unit":"px","size":12,"sizes":[]},"accordion_item_title_space_between":{"unit":"px","size":12,"sizes":[]},"max_items_expended":"multiple"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqc0","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt0","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Oui. L’article 1367 du Code civil reconnaît à la signature électronique la même valeur qu’une signature manuscrite, dès lors qu’elle identifie son auteur et garantit l’intégrité de l’acte. Le règlement européen eIDAS encadre les procédés admis. La force probante varie selon le niveau utilisé : seule la signature qualifiée bénéficie d’une présomption de fiabilité ; pour les niveaux simple et avancé, le juge apprécie les preuves produites, d’où l’importance du dossier de preuve horodaté.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc1","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt1","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Les trois niveaux du règlement eIDAS se distinguent par l’exigence d’identification du signataire. La signature simple repose sur une identification déclarative ; l’avancée exige un lien univoque avec le signataire et la détection de toute modification ; la qualifiée ajoute un certificat qualifié délivré après vérification d’identité, et bénéficie seule d’une présomption légale de fiabilité. Plus l’enjeu du document est élevé, plus le niveau recommandé monte.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc2","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt2","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Oui. Dans Lumen Juris, la signature électronique simple est incluse gratuitement : vous signez votre contrat en ligne et l’envoyez à votre cocontractant pour signature à distance, avec horodatage et dossier de preuve. La signature avancée, adossée à un prestataire de confiance certifié eIDAS via notre intégration DocuSign, est proposée en option payante pour les documents à plus fort enjeu.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc3","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt3","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Préparez le document dans Lumen Juris, placez les zones de signature, signez, puis envoyez : votre cocontractant reçoit un lien sécurisé, consulte le contrat et signe depuis son ordinateur ou son mobile, sans créer de compte. Vous suivez l’avancement en temps réel et récupérez le document signé accompagné de son dossier de preuve horodaté.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc4","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt4","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>La quasi-totalité des actes sous signature privée : contrats commerciaux, NDA, contrats de travail et avenants, baux, mandats, conventions d’honoraires, procès-verbaux. Quelques actes restent soumis à des formes particulières (actes authentiques notariés, certains actes du droit de la famille) : pour ceux-là, la signature électronique qualifiée ou l’intervention d’un officier public demeure nécessaire.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc5","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt5","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Le dossier de preuve, horodatage, empreinte du document, journal des événements, identité déclarée des signataires, constitue un faisceau d’indices solide que le juge apprécie souverainement. Il renforce considérablement votre position sans garantir l’issue d’un contentieux : aucun prestataire sérieux ne peut promettre un résultat judiciaire. Pour les enjeux élevés, privilégiez la signature avancée.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc6","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt6","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Les documents et données de Lumen Juris sont hébergés en France et traités conformément au RGPD. Vos contrats ne sont ni revendus ni utilisés pour entraîner des modèles d’IA tiers, et les échanges sont chiffrés. Pour la signature avancée, notre prestataire de services de confiance est certifié au sens du règlement eIDAS.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"ljfqc7","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ljfqt7","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Non. La signature en ligne de Lumen Juris fonctionne entièrement dans le navigateur, pour vous comme pour vos cocontractants. Vous préparez, signez et envoyez vos contrats depuis votre espace ; le signataire ouvre simplement un lien sécurisé. Aucune installation, aucun matériel spécifique : un ordinateur ou un smartphone suffit.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#39445A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true}]}],"isInner":false},{"id":"ljcta9","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","flex_align_items":"center","background_background":"gradient","background_color":"#EAF1F9","background_color_b":"#A4BFDF","background_gradient_angle":{"unit":"deg","size":135,"sizes":[]},"min_height":{"unit":"px","size":360,"sizes":[]},"flex_justify_content":"center","background_overlay_background":"classic","background_overlay_image":{"url":"","id":"","size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"-17","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"ljctah","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Signez votre prochain contrat en ligne","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto Slab","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":32,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"800","title_color":"#1C1C1C","typography_text_transform":"uppercase","text_stroke_text_stroke_type":"yes","align_mobile":"center"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ljctat","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Essayer gratuitement la signature électronique en ligne de Lumen Juris, et découvrez le cycle de vie complet du contrat, de la génération par IA à la contrathèque.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","text_color":"#000000","align":"center","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"41c801f","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Demandez une démo","link":{"url":"https://www.lumenjuris.com/contactez-nous/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""},"typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_weight":"700","typography_font_style":"normal","typography_text_decoration":"none","background_color":"#FFFFFF","button_box_shadow_box_shadow_type":"yes","button_box_shadow_box_shadow":{"horizontal":0,"vertical":0,"blur":10,"spread":0,"color":"rgba(230.81748962402344, 229.81393532131028, 229.81393532131028, 0.5)"},"border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"6","right":"6","bottom":"6","left":"6","isLinked":true}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"button"}],"isInner":false}]
